{"type":"message","id":"5fd2e344","parentId":"c837b0a9","timestamp":"2026-05-17T02:00:41.776Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_3505fcc336844baba25b89f1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# HEARTBEAT.md Template\n\n```markdown\n# Keep this file empty (or with only comments) to skip heartbeat API calls.\n\n# Add tasks below when you want the agent to check something periodically.\n```\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778983241775}}
{"type":"message","id":"fde92d9f","parentId":"5fd2e344","timestamp":"2026-05-17T02:02:25.348Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full picture. Let me summarize:\n\nThe Feishu ping at `https://open.larksuite.com/open-apis/bot/v1/openclaw_bot/ping` is getting HTTP 429 responses. This ping is part of the OpenClaw's built-in heartbeat mechanism for the Feishu channel - it's a custom bot endpoint (`openclaw_bot/ping`) which isn't a standard Lark API endpoint and the bot SDK is getting rate-limited.\n\nThe heartbeat requests are happening approximately every 2 minutes (from the log timestamps) and keep failing with 429.\n\nThe \"feishu channel being throttled\" has TWO possible interpretations:\n1. The Feishu/Lark API itself is rate-limiting our ping requests (internal server-side rate limiting on Lark's end)\n2. The nvidia provider is rate-limited separately - this is a model API issue, not a feishu channel issue\n\nThe user probably means the actual Feishu channel isn't sending/receiving messages, which could be due to the ping failure. If the heartbeat/ping keeps failing, the channel might consider itself \"down\" and stop processing messages.\n\nLet me write this up clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"主公，查清楚了。症结已现，两个问题并存，但飞书通道的问题尤为突出。\n\n---\n\n## 诊断结果\n\n### ⚠️ 问题一：飞书心跳 Ping 被限流（主因）\n\nOpenClaw 持续向 Lark API 发心跳请求，返回 **HTTP 429 Too Many Requests**：\n\n```\nPOST https://open.larksuite.com/open-apis/bot/v1/openclaw_bot/ping → 429\n```\n\n- 请求频率：每 **~2 分钟** 一次\n- 受影响账号：至少 2 个（Talus 和另一个 Bot 账号，不同 token）\n- 连锁反应：心跳卡死 → gateway 报告 `stuck session: agent:main:cron:echo-platform-heartbeat`（持续卡在 processing 状态）\n- 结果：飞书通道的心跳断了，通道可能被 gateway 判定为不稳定甚至下线\n\n### ⚠️ 问题二：NVIDIA/Minimax 模型 API 也被限流（次要）\n\n```\nmodel: minimaxai/minimax-m2.7, provider: nvidia\nrawErrorPreview: \"429 status code (no body)\"\n```\n\n这是模型调用层面的限流，跟飞书通道无关，但会导致回复失败。\n\n---\n\n## 需要主公决定的事\n\n**关于飞书通道**，目前可选的路径有三条：\n\n| 路径 | 做法 | 效果 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **① 调低心跳频率** | 在 `openclaw.json` 中配置 Feishu channel 的 ping interval 拉长（如 5-10 分钟） | 减少请求量，避开 Lark 限流阈值 |\n| **② 重启通道** | 重启 gateway，重新建立 token 和连接 | 可能临时恢复，但限流问题会复发 |\n| **③ 查 Lark 后台** | 去飞书开放平台查看 Bot 应用是否被限流，或 tenant 级别的调用配额是否已超限 | 从根上解决问题 |\n\n**路径①是止损最快的方式。** 但需要确认 OpenClaw 当前版本是否支持配置 Feishu channel 的 ping interval。\n\n要我执行哪条路，还是先查一下配置项再定？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778983241780,"responseId":"1dc010a80d464d2285b4dc73c313d964"}}
