{"type":"message","id":"e972fa0e","parentId":"bc111977","timestamp":"2026-05-17T02:02:25.354Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ca4f8b92e8b84ac7938c5390","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Session: 2026-05-16 15:16:51 UTC\n\n- **Session Key**: agent:wxlee:openclaw-weixin:a23ee0675df2-im-bot:direct:o9cq802uvmveggp0xkfm4o7acdrg@im.wechat\n- **Session ID**: f91bf92a-0ccd-483f-b17a-a61f51c3dbab\n- **Source**: openclaw-weixin\n\n## Conversation Summary\n\nuser: Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"o9cq802UVmvEGGP0xkFm4O7AcdRg@im.wechat\",\n  \"message_id\": \"openclaw-weixin:1778943752330-5b3081ea\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-16 15:02 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\n小夜小夜\nassistant: 主公，我在。\n\n看时间，你那儿已是深夜（UTC+8 23:02）。深夜唤我，是有要事相商，还是只是打个招呼？\nuser: 小夜小夜\nassistant: 主公，我在。\n\n看时间，你那儿已是深夜（UTC+8 23:02）。深夜唤我，是有要事相商，还是只是打个招呼？\nuser: Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"o9cq802UVmvEGGP0xkFm4O7AcdRg@im.wechat\",\n  \"message_id\": \"openclaw-weixin:1778943901960-100768f1\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-16 15:05 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\n我是想让你看看，飞书通道好像有点哑火了，被限流了似的\nassistant: 找到症结了。看日志一目了然——飞书通道的 ping/heartbeat 请求被 Lark API 限流了，持续返回 **HTTP 429 (Too Many Requests)**。\n\n让我进一步查清楚限制的来源和可调\nuser: Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"o9cq802UVmvEGGP0xkFm4O7AcdRg@im.wechat\",\n  \"message_id\": \"openclaw-weixin:1778943901960-100768f1\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-16 15:05 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\n我是想让你看看，飞书通道好像有点哑火了，被限流了似的\nuser: Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"o9cq802UVmvEGGP0xkFm4O7AcdRg@im.wechat\",\n  \"message_id\": \"openclaw-weixin:1778943901960-100768f1\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-16 15:05 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\n我是想让你看看，飞书通道好像有点哑火了，被限流了似的\nuser: 我是想让你看看，飞书通道好像有点哑火了，被限流了似的\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778982793408}}
