{"type":"message","id":"f599b86f","parentId":"d83f32a8","timestamp":"2026-05-17T02:02:25.358Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a very clear picture of the issue. Let me analyze the logs:\n\n1. **Two separate issues are conflated** - the user said \"飞书通道好像有点哑火了\" (feishu channel seems muted/throttled), but from the logs I can see:\n\n**Issue 1: Feishu Bot Ping endpoint 429**\n- The ping/heartbeat request to Lark API is returning HTTP 429\n- URL: `POST https://open.larksuite.com/open-apis/bot/v1/openclaw_bot/ping`\n- This is hitting the bot's custom ping endpoint, not a standard Lark API endpoint\n- This is causing \"stuck session\" warnings (`agent:main:cron:echo-platform-heartbeat` stuck in processing state for 120+ seconds)\n\n**Issue 2: Nvidia API rate limit**\n- The model provider (nvidia with minimaxai/minimax-m2.7) is also getting rate limited:\n  - `\"error\":\"⚠️ API rate limit reached. Please try again later.\"`\n  - `\"failoverReason\":\"rate_limit\"`\n  - `\"rawErrorPreview\":\"429 status code (no body)\"`\n  - `\"provider\":\"nvidia\"`\n\nWait, looking more carefully - the URL for the Feishu ping is `open.larksuite.com/open-apis/bot/v1/openclaw_bot/ping` - this is a custom bot ping endpoint, not a standard Lark bot endpoint (standard would be `open.larksuite.com/open-apis/bot/v1/ping`).\n\nThe two 429 issues are:\n1. Feishu ping endpoint `open.larksuite.com/open-apis/bot/v1/openclaw_bot/ping` → 429\n2. Nvidia provider (minimax) rate limit → 429 \n\nThese are separate issues. The user was asking about the Feishu channel being throttled.\n\nLet me also check how many Feishu accounts are configured and how frequently the heartbeat is firing. Looking at the logs, the ping is happening every ~2 minutes, and there seem to be at least 2 different tokens being used (t-g2075gngVMRWXDN6FJZUSVVM3CC5LPG5SNRIIHUH and t-g2075h1e3WCLICXFYYYMSGQVSQXXQ7BBS7U2ZIRB).\n\nLet me check the Feishu extension code to understand the ping interval and how to configure it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e88e0a0f8bd54f6581d6ec3a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /home/node/.openclaw/extensions/feishu -name \"*.js\" 2>/dev/null | head -20; cat /home/node/.openclaw/extensions/feishu/package.json 2>/dev/null | head -30","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778983041980,"responseId":"c3953127ef794d8699507f0795c37cb9"}}
