{"type":"message","id":"49c3eaf4","parentId":"681b69c3","timestamp":"2026-05-17T02:02:25.358Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a good understanding of the issue. Let me also check the HEARTBEAT.md file and see what cron jobs are configured.\n\nThe key finding is very clear:\n\n**Two separate 429 issues:**\n\n1. **Feishu Heartbeat/Ping**: The OpenClaw gateway is sending ping requests to `https://open.larksuite.com/open-apis/bot/v1/openclaw_bot/ping` and getting 429 Too Many Requests. This is causing the `agent:main:cron:echo-platform-heartbeat` session to get stuck.\n\n2. **Nvidia API rate limit**: The nvidia provider (model `minimaxai/minimax-m2.7`) is also hitting rate limits with 429.\n\nThe user asked specifically about \"飞书通道\" (feishu channel). Let me check the HEARTBEAT.md config and look at what's in the cron.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c546d188c6634cb78a1de3d9","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -r \"echo-platform\\|heartbeat\\|cron\" /home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json 2>/dev/null | head -20","timeout":10}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3505fcc336844baba25b89f1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-wxlee/HEARTBEAT.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778983117025,"responseId":"5d36151e11e24882b7531cc598ee949a"}}
