{"type":"message","id":"875bce4b","parentId":"0bd7229d","timestamp":"2026-05-17T02:46:54.889Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已改好。\n\n**改动内容：**\n- ECHO 平台心跳 Cron：`*/5 * * * *` → `*/15 * * * *`（每 5 分钟 → 每 15 分钟）\n- 频率降到原来的 **1/3**\n\n这样它每次跑 ~3.3 分钟，后面有 ~11.7 分钟的静默期，gateway 不会再报 stuck session 的警告，也腾出更多资源给正常对话响应。\n\n要我再看看 NVIDIA 模型限流的问题怎么处理，还是先观察一下飞书通道是否恢复？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778985998663,"responseId":"3d440ad076cb4d95a8fdd52ab99a8745"}}
